a373d], v4.6.dev6.official [dec5a373d]\n- Not reproducible in: v4.5.1.stable, v4.6.dev2.official [7864ac801], v4.6.dev5.official [f5918a9d3]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev (dec5a373d) - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Mon, 24 Nov 2025 15:21:09 +0000 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (nvidia; 580.105.08) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13400F (16 threads) - 15.37 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe `interface/editor/use_native_file_dialogs` editor setting can make file selection use a native file dialog instead of the Godot one.\n\nOnce enabled, file selection in the editor uses a native file dialog instead, but it also prints an error:\n\n```\nERROR: Condition \"!windows.has(p_window)\" is true. Returning: INVALID_SCREEN\n   at: window_get_current_screen (platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp:2301)\n```\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/59f58a0d-dc06-4bc1-b111-cc998b14ab0c\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Enable `interface/editor/use_native_file_dialogs` in Editor Settings.\n2. Try opening any editor file dialog in the editor. e.g., Scene > Open Scene in the main editor, or Clicking Import in the project manager.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.